# Keep the podman build context minimal.
#
# The sandbox Dockerfile only COPYs `Justfile` and the sandbox scripts; the
# source tree is bind-mounted at container runtime. Without this file the entire
# repo — every edict worktree, vendor/, .git/ and the build logs — is shipped
# into the podman VM, exhausts its disk and fails the build with:
#   mkdir /var/tmp/libpod_builder...: no space left on device

.git
.gitignore
.gocache
vendor
.agents/worktrees
jobs
*.log
*.out
asimi
asimi_linux
coverage.*
test_tmp
profiles
dist
notes
tmp
.envrc
